(1, 'Reliable Import-Export Services Connecting Businesses Globally:', '<p>At We Care India, we specialize in providing dependable import-export solutions, ensuring businesses around the world can access high-quality products and services. Our robust network and expertise make global trade smooth and efficient.</p>', 'active', '2026-02-14 05:46:52', '2026-02-14 05:48:15'),
(2, 'Commitment to Quality and Timely Deliveries:', '<p>We prioritize delivering the best. With stringent quality checks and a focus on punctuality, We Care India ensures that every shipment meets client expectations and arrives on time, every time.</p>', 'active', '2026-02-14 05:51:19', '2026-02-14 05:51:19'),
(3, 'Focused on Building Long-Term Relationships with Clients:', '<p>More than just a business, We Care India aims to build lasting partnerships. By understanding client needs and exceeding expectations, we become a trusted ally in their growth journey.</p>', 'active', '2026-02-14 05:52:30', '2026-02-14 05:52:30'),
(4, 'Focused on Building Long-Term Relationships with Clients:', '<p>More than just a business, We Care India aims to build lasting partnerships. By understanding client needs and exceeding expectations, we become a trusted ally in their growth journey.</p>', 'active', '2026-02-14 05:53:01', '2026-02-14 05:53:01');

